   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Two bands of 44 px: the site above (the brand, the report of a bug; the menu, the search, the settings\nand the account in version 2), the open builds below, at every width. Layout only, no colours:\naccent = must stand out; the real colour is chosen in the mock-up. Newest at the top.",
   "originalText": "Two bands of 44 px: the site above (the brand, the report of a bug; the menu, the search, the settings\nand the account in version 2), the open builds below, at every width. Layout only, no colours:\naccent = must stand out; the real colour is chosen in the mock-up. Newest at the top.",
