   "text": "1. The shade of each band: the site darker, the tabs lighter, or the same.\n2. The report of a bug: an icon alone, or the icon and « Report a bug ».\n3. At 2,560 px, the tabs keep 168 px, or grow to show more of the name.",
   "originalText": "1. The shade of each band: the site darker, the tabs lighter, or the same.\n2. The report of a bug: an icon alone, or the icon and « Report a bug ».\n3. At 2,560 px, the tabs keep 168 px, or grow to show more of the name.",
